    crm:P3_has_note "Arrangement Sketchbooks, housed in document boxes and stored on shelves, are organized by Joseph Upton into 13 subject categories.",
        "Former Title or Title Variations Ernst Herzeld; Skizzenbuch XXIV: Messungen",
        "General - Title is provided by Xavier Courouble, FSg Archives cataloger, based on Herzfeld's original sketchbook title and Joseph Upton's Catalogue of the Herzfeld Archive.",
        "Local Numbers Ernst Herzfeld Papers; SK-24 FSA A.06 02.09.24",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 1 to 15 reads, \"Pasargadae [(Iran)].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 17 to 21 reads, \"Naqsh-i Rustam [(Iran)].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 23 to 37 reads, \"Khurha [(Iran)], columns; measurements and calculations of heights.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 230 to 250 reads, \"Pasargadae [(Iran)]: calculations referring to Skizzenbuch Pas. I.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 39 to 63 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], Terrace.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 65 to 75 reads, \"Naqsh-i Rustam [(Iran)].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 77 to 79 reads, \"Firuzabad [(Iran)].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 81 to 229 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)]: Terrace and city area.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Original handwritten title on cover reads: \"Ernst Herzfeld; Skizzenbuch XXIV: Messungen.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - SK-24 is the twenty-fourth of a series of thirty-five sketchbooks (Skizzenbücher), in which Ernst Herzfeld primarly recorded measurements for topographical maps with calculations related to Firuzabad (Iran), Khurha (Iran), Pasargadae (Iran), Naqsh-i Rustam (Iran), and Persepolis (Iran).",
        "Scope and Contents Ernst Herzfeld Papers, Series 2: Sketchbooks; Subseries 2.09: Measurements: Sketchbook 24" ;
