    crm:P3_has_note "Arrangement Sketchbooks, housed in document boxes and stored on shelves, are organized by Joseph Upton into 13 subject categories.",
        "Date/Time and Place of an Event Note \"The field activities of the Persepolis Expedition were initiated by Professor Ernst Herzfeld in Spring 1931, after the French archaeological monopoly had been replaced by the new Antiquity Law, which opened Iran to archaeological field work by other nations. The expedition ended in fall 1939, after the outbreak of World War II. [...] At the end of 1934, Herzfeld was removed from his position as expedition director. He left Persepolis for the last time toward the end of November 1934 and went to London.\" [Elspeth R. M. Dusinberre, \"Herzfeld in Persepolis\", Ernst Herzfeld and the Development of Near Eastern Studies, 1900-1950. Edited by Ann Gunter and Stefan R. Hauser. Leiden: Brill, 2005. P.137 and P.161]",
        "Former Title or Title Variations Ernst Herzeld; Skizzenbuch XX: Persepolis",
        "Funding note \"Herzfeld returned to Persepolis in 1931 as field director. The project was conducted under the auspices of the Oriental Institute at the University of Chicago, with additional financial assistance from other American individuals and institutions.\" [Elspeth R. M. Dusinberre, \"Herzfeld in Persepolis\", Ernst Herzfeld and the Development of Near Eastern Studies, 1900-1950. Edited by Ann Gunter and Stefan R. Hauser. Leiden: Brill, 2005. P.146]",
        "General - Title is provided by Xavier Courouble, FSg Archives cataloger, based on Herzfeld's original sketchbook title and Joseph Upton's Catalogue of the Herzfeld Archive.",
        "Local Numbers Ernst Herzfeld Papers; SK-20 FSA A.06 02.07.20",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 1 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [ruins of Achaemenian structures, south of Terrace Complex]: measured drawings of fallen crenellated blocks.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 10 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [ruins of Achaemenian structures, south of Terrace Complex]: plan [of subsidiary rooms south of the square central hall].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 11 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [ruins of Achaemenian structures, south of Terrace Complex]: plan [of subsidiary rooms west of the square central hall].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 14 reads, \"Vicinity of Istakhr [(Iran)], plans and elevations of two astudans (astodans).\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 15 reads, \"Vicinity of Istakhr [(Iran)], sketch of two astodans, [see FSA A.6 05.1397].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 2 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [ruins of Achaemenian structures, south of Terrace Complex]: banister with crenellations, small staircase.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 20 reads, \"Garmabad [(Iran)], cliff with nineteen astodans.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 21 reads, \"Garmabad [(Iran)], cliff with single large astodan, [see FSA A.6 04.GN.2417; FSA A.6 04.GN.2418].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 22 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [topographical] measurements for area from Persepolis to Istakhr; additional [topographical] measurements from area near water [conduit].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 23 reads, \"[Istakhr (Iran)], [excavation sounding of the south-east gate], plan, [see FSA A.6 05.0826], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.2411; FSA A.6 04.GN.2412].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 24 reads, \"[Istakhr (Iran)], [excavation sounding of the south-east gate], plan of stone wall and well, [see FSA A.6 05.0826].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 25 reads, \"[Vicinity of] Persepolis [(Iran)], plan and elevation of small astodans.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 26 reads, \"[Vicinity of] Persepolis [(Iran)], plan and elevation of small [graves].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 27 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Terrace Complex, South Wall]: elevation of the [south-west corner] of the terrace retaining wall, [see FSA A.6 05.0845], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.2271; FSA A.6 04.GN.2272; FSA A.6 04.GN.2274].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 3 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [ruins of Achaemenian structures, south of Terrace Complex]: [topographical] measurements; measurements for elevation of ruins on the Terrace [Complex].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 30 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Terrace Complex, south wall]: plan [of the south-west corner of the terrace retaining wall], [see FSA A.6 05.0845; FSA A.6 05.0851], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.1574; FSA A.6 04.GN.2271].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 31 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], unidentified plan.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 4 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], measured column bases, pair of fallen lions, and masons' marks on bases, [see FSA A.6 05.1143].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 44 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [courtyard between Palace H and the Tachara Palace (Palace of Darius)]: plan [of the retaining wall bordering the north side of Palace H], [FSA A.6 05.0851].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 45 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Palace H]: detailed measurements of column bases [from the main hall], [FSA A.6 05.0851].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 5 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [ruins of Achaemenian structures, south of Terrace Complex]: plan [of the square central hall].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 6 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [ruins of Achaemenian structures, south of Terrace Complex]: plan [of subsidiary rooms east of the square central hall].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 62 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Apadana]: column bases of west vestibule [(portico)], [see FSA A.6 05.0852; FSA A.6 05.0878], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.1621; FSA A.6 04.GN.2301].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 64 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Apadana]: [plan of two doorways giving access to the [(audience)] hall through the north portico], [see FSA A.6 05.0852; FSA A.6 05.0878], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.2302].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 68 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Apadana, Audience Hall]: [plan of floor with pivoting door device, from western doorway].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 7 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [ruins of Achaemenian structures, south of Terrace Complex]: plan [of subsidiary rooms north of the square central hall].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 72 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [area north of Terrace Complex]: plan of ruins in the vicinity of the re-used Achaemenid doorway.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 73 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [area north of Terrace Complex]: plan of ruins in the vicinity of the re-used Achaemenid doorway.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 74 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [area north of Terrace Complex]: plan of ruins in the vicinity of the re-used Achaemenid doorway.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 75 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [area north of Terrace Complex]: plan of ruins in the vicinity of the re-used Achaemenid doorway.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 76 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [area north of Terrace Complex]: plan of ruins in the vicinity of the re-used Achaemenid doorway.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 77 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [area north of Terrace Complex]: plan of ruins in the vicinity of the re-used Achaemenid doorway.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 78 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [area north of Terrace Complex]: plan of ruins in the vicinity of the re-used Achaemenid doorway.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 79 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [area north of Terrace Complex]: [topographical] measurements.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 8 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [ruins of Achaemenian structures, south of Terrace Complex]: [topographical] measurements to establish levels of ruins.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 80 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], re-used Achaemenid doorway, north of the Terrace Complex.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 9 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [ruins of Achaemenian structures, south of Terrace Complex]: plan [of portico east of the square central hall].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 12 and 13 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [ruins of Achaemenian structures, south of Terrace Complex]: measured plans and reconstruction of crenellated blocks.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 16 to 19 reads, \"Vicinity of Istakhr [(Iran)], plans and elevations of more astodans (astudans).\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 28 and 29 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Terrace Complex, south wall]: elevation [of the south-west corner of the terrace retaining wall], [see FSA A.6 05.0845; FSA A.6 05.0851], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.2271; FSA A.6 04.GN.2272; FSA A.6 04.GN.2274].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 32 and 33 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Terrace Complex, Hadish (Palace of Xerxes)]: section elevation [of the southern wall of the palace], [see FSA A.6 05.0845], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.1576; FSA A.6 04.GN.2335].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 34 and 35 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Terrace Complex, South Wall]: elevation [of the several south-west corners included in the plan en crémaillère of the terrace complex], [see FSA A.6 05.0845; FSA A.6 05.0851], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.1574].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 36 to 43 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Terrace Complex, south wall]: plan [of the several south-west corners included in the plan en crémaillère of the terrace complex], [see FSA A.6 05.0845; FSA A.6 05.0851], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.1574].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 46 to 49 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Terrace Complex, south wall]: elevation of sections of retaining wall, [see FSA A.6 05.0845], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.1574; FSA A.6 04.GN.2273].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 50 to 51 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], Apadana: plans of the north-west corner of the platform, [see FSA A.6 05.0852; FSA A.6 05.0878], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.2268].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 52 to 53 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], Apadana: plans [of the north side of the north-west corner of the platform], [see FSA A.6 05.0852; FSA A.6 05.0878], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.2268].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 54 and 55 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Terrace Complex, west wall]: elevation of [terrace western wall between the Gate of All Lands and the Apadana]; column bases of Apadana.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 56 to 57 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], elevation of foundation of Apadana; and underground drainage channel.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 58 to 59 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Terrace Complex, west wall]: plan of terrace retaining wall by Apadana, [see FSA A.6 05.0852].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 60 to 61 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Apadana, North Side]: plan of retaining wall along the stairways, [see FSA A.6 05.0849; FSA A.6 05.0878].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 63 and 65 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Apadana]: column bases of central [(audience)] hall, [see FSA A.6 05.0852; FSA A.6 05.0878], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.2302].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, captions for pg. 66 and 67 reads, \"Persepolis [(Iran)], [Apadana]: column bases of north and east vestibules [(porticoes)], [see FSA A.6 05.0852; FSA A.6 05.0878], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.2302], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.1619; FSA A.6 04.GN.1620; FSA A.6 04.GN.2310].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Original handwritten title on cover reads: \"Ernst Herzfeld; Skizzenbuch XX: Persepolis.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - SK-20 is the twentieth of a series of thirty-five sketchbooks (Skizzenbücher), in which Ernst Herzfeld, assisted by Karl Bergner, recorded his observations on topography, archaeological remains, architecture, and decorative motifs related to the vicinity of Istakhr (Iran), and Persepolis (Iran).",
        "Scope and Contents Ernst Herzfeld Papers, Series 2: Sketchbooks; Subseries 2.07: Persepolis: Sketchbook 20" ;
