    crm:P3_has_note "Arrangement Sketchbooks, housed in document boxes and stored on shelves, are organized by Joseph Upton into 13 subject categories.",
        "Former Title or Title Variations Ernst Herzeld; Skizzenbuch XXVI: Sammlung Hahn etc.",
        "General - Title is provided by Xavier Courouble, FSg Archives cataloger, based on Herzfeld's original sketchbook title and Joseph Upton's Catalogue of the Herzfeld Archive.",
        "Local Numbers Ernst Herzfeld Papers; SK-26 FSA A.06 02.11.26",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 1 reads, \"small stone figure.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 10 reads, \"round [stamp] seal stone with row of animals, [see N-89, inventory number 239], Fara-type, [3.03.1923].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 11 reads, \"round [stamp] seal stone, [see N-89, inventory number 235], limestone, cf. Tepe Giyan, [3.03.1923].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 12 reads, \"small head of animal.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 13 reads, \"[small] white limestone masque [(head)], [see N-89, inventory number 195], [12.03.1923].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 14 reads, \"small head, aragonit, [see N-89, inventory number 193], [12.03.1923].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 15 reads, \"small haematite head, [see N-89, inventory number 194].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 16 reads, \"small limestone standing figure.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 16a reads, \"small clay figurine, [Baghdad], [see FSA A.6 04.GN.0142; FSA A.6 04.GN.0443].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 17 reads, \"small yellowish-green limestone standing figure.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 18 reads, \"aragonit, very white.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 19 reads, \"flat limestone seal.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 2 reads, \"lapislazuli inscribed roll [(cylinder)] seal with cuneiform inscription, from Wanna al-sudum.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 20 reads, \"round [stamp] seal, black stone, [see N-89, inventory number 240].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 21 reads, \"bright red flint seal, [see N-89, inventory number 238], [3.03.1923].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 22 reads, \"gray flint seal, [see N-89, inventory number 236], Fara-type, [3.03.1923].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 23 reads, \"dark gray flint [stamp] seal.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 24 reads, \"irregular, deeply cut [stamp] seal, with notes.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 25 reads, \"round, gray black [stamp] seal, [see N-89, inventory number 237].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - In Finding Aid, caption for pg. 26 reads, \"black stone round [stamp] seal, [see N-89, inventory number 772], [19.06.1923].\"",
